WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks to
a newly-developed technology,

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:04.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
we here at "Late Night"
now have the ability to record

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:07.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
the tiny voice that is inside
Donald Trump's head.

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you might be surprised
to know that,

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:12.212
like everyone's inner voice,
like all of our inner voices,

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:15.749
Donald Trump's is filled with
paralyzing fear and self-doubt.

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:16.850 line:92%
So here it is, once again,

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
the tiny voice in the back
of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:24.858 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:26.626 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey, Donald.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the tiny voice
in the back of your head.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:31.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I want to remind you
that this is a medal ceremony,

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.401 line:92%
but that medal is not for you.

00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:38.038 size:81% position:41%
So, whatever you do,
don't take that medal.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:41.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, but you want
to take it so bad.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.909 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It's such a good medal.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.444 line:92%
You can't stop looking at it,

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:47.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
thinking about
how pretty it would look

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:48.081 size:78% position:39% line:92%
around your fat neck.

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:50.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, hey, maybe someday
you'll get a medal.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what you'd
get a medal for?

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
Awkwardly swinging
your body side to side

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:59.626
while your dead arms hang limp
alongside your hulking mass.

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:02.962 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

